```

3. Create an instance of the AEAD GCM cipher class and initialize it with the secret key:

```java
Cipher cipher = Cipher.getInstance("AES/GCM/NoPadding");
cipher.init(Cipher.ENCRYPT_MODE, secretKey);
```

4. Set the authentication data (AAD) using the `updateAAD` method:

```java
byte[] aad = "your_authentication_data".getBytes();
cipher.updateAAD(aad);
```

5. Encrypt or decrypt data using the cipher object:

```java
// To encrypt data
byte[] plaintext = "your_plaintext_data".getBytes();
byte[] ciphertext = cipher.doFinal(plaintext);

// To decrypt data
