        ValidateIssuerSigningKey = true,
        ValidIssuer = "your_issuer",
        ValidAudience = "your_audience",
        IssuerSigningKey = "your_secret_key"
    };
});
```
Replace `"your_issuer"` with the issuer of your JWT tokens, `"your_audience"` with the audience of your JWT tokens, and `"your_secret_key"` with the secret key used to sign the tokens.
